hat slides in from an edge and covers part of the page."},{"key":"head","cn":"标题栏","en":"Header","desc":"标题加关闭，说清这是什么","desc_en":"A title that makes the panel’s purpose clear"},{"key":"body","cn":"内容区","en":"Body","desc":"详情、筛选或表单，能承载更长排版与较多操作项","desc_en":"Use it for details, filters, or short forms that need more room than a popover."},{"key":"foot","cn":"底部操作","en":"Footer","desc":"可选，放保存 / 关闭","desc_en":"Optional actions, such as Save or Close"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"右侧抽屉","en":"Right","demo":"<div class=\"drawer-scene\"><div class=\"dm-skel\"><i style=\"width:70%\"></i><i style=\"width:85%\"></i></div><div class=\"drawer-mask\"></div><div class=\"drawer-panel\"><div class=\"drawer-head\">任务详情 <span>×</span></div><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:90%\"></i><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:75%\"></i></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"drawer-scene\"><div class=\"dm-skel\"><i style=\"width:70%\"></i><i style=\"width:85%\"></i></div><div class=\"drawer-mask\"></div><div class=\"drawer-panel\"><div class=\"drawer-head\">Task details <span>×</span></div><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:90%\"></i><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:75%\"></i></div></div>","when":"查看详情或填写表单时","when_en":"When viewing details or filling out a form"},{"cn":"左侧抽屉","en":"Left","demo":"<div class=\"drawer-scene\"><div class=\"dm-skel\"><i style=\"width:70%\"></i><i style=\"width:85%\"></i></div><div class=\"drawer-mask\"></div><div class=\"drawer-panel is-left\"><div class=\"drawer-head\">导航 <span>×</span></div><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:65%\"></i></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"drawer-scene\"><div class=\"dm-skel\"><i style=\"width:70%\"></i><i style=\"width:85%\"></i></div><div class=\"drawer-mask\"></div><div class=\"drawer-panel is-left\"><div class=\"drawer-head\">Navigation <span>×</span></div><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:65%\"></i></div></di