s room for the form while preserving order context and the list position after closing.","correct":true},{"id":"small-modal","label":"Open a fixed-size confirmation modal in the center","feedback":"A confirmation modal suits a short decision; a full address form becomes cramped and hides more context.","correct":false},{"id":"separate-page","label":"Navigate to an address page and return to the top after saving","feedback":"A separate page can edit the address, but it loses the requested order context and list position.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"在订单列表右侧打开编辑收货地址的抽屉，保留背景订单和原滚动位置。抽屉要有标题、关闭入口和保存反馈；请验证键盘焦点、关闭返回位置以及小屏布局。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Open a shipping-address editor in a right drawer while preserving the order and scroll position behind it. Add a title, close control, and save feedback, then test focus, return position, and mobile layout."}},"scenes":["列表行详情","筛选面板","编辑成员表单","移动端菜单"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Mobile navigation","m":"drawer-detail"},{"t":"Filter panel","m":"drawer-filter"},{"t":"Record details","m":"drawer-form"},{"t":"A short edit that benefits from page context","m":"drawer-menu"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use a narrow drawer for dense, complex content","m":"drawer-as-confirm","bad":true},{"t":"Open drawers inside drawers","m":"drawer-tiny","bad":true},{"t":"Let it cover essential context without a reason","m":"drawer-nested","bad":true},{"t":"Hide how to close or return","m":"tabs-steps"}],"scenes":["Mobile menu","Product filters","Order details","Quick edit"],"sceneUI":["<div class=\"drawer-sc\">\n      <div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\"><span>Homepage redesign</span><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">In progress</span></div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\"><span>Review paymen